---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us" description="Learn about Davis Weather Station, an independent directory connecting customers with authorized Davis Instruments resellers.">
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">About Us</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">Connecting weather enthusiasts with trusted Davis Instruments resellers</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#00529B]">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Davis Weather Station is an independent resource dedicated to helping customers worldwide find authorized Davis Instruments resellers. We make it easier to discover trusted dealers who can provide expert advice, sales, installation, and support for Davis weather monitoring solutions.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Our goal is to bridge the gap between customers and the network of authorized Davis Instruments resellers, ensuring you can find the right products and support for your weather monitoring needs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#00529B]">About Davis Instruments</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Davis Instruments has been a world leader in the design, manufacture, and marketing of high-quality personal and professional weather instrumentation for over 50 years. Their weather stations are used by meteorologists, farmers, schools, research institutions, and weather enthusiasts around the globe.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Known for their accuracy, reliability, and durability, Davis weather stations provide precise environmental data for agriculture, education, research, and home weather monitoring.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#00529B]">Important Note</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            This website is an independent initiative and is not officially affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Davis Instruments. While we strive to maintain accurate and up-to-date reseller information, we recommend verifying details directly with the resellers or through official Davis Instruments channels.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Some product images and descriptions may reference Davis Instruments' proprietary materials used for informational purposes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 text-center">
        <a href="/resellers/" class="inline-block bg-[#00529B] hover:bg-[#003d73] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
          Browse Resellers
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
